{"id":143,"name":"snorlax","speciesId":143,"dex":143,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["normal"],"stats":{"hp":160,"attack":110,"defense":65,"special-attack":65,"special-defense":110,"speed":30},"abilities":[{"name":"immunity","hidden":false},{"name":"thick-fat","hidden":false},{"name":"gluttony","hidden":true}],"height":21,"weight":4600,"baseExp":189,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/143.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/143.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/143.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/143.ogg","genus":"Sleeping Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon adormecido","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"Very lazy. Just eats and sleeps. As its rotund bulk builds, it becomes steadily more slothful."},{"version":"yellow","text":"Will eat anything, even if the food happens to be a little moldy. It never gets an upset stomach."},{"version":"gold","text":"What sounds like its cry may ac­ tually be its snores or the rumblings of its hungry belly."},{"version":"silver","text":"Its stomach's di­ gestive juices can dissolve any kind of poison. It can even eat things off the ground."},{"version":"crystal","text":"This POKéMON's stomach is so strong, even eating moldy or rotten food will not affect it."},{"version":"ruby","text":"SNORLAX’s typical day consists of nothing more than eating and sleeping. It is such a docile POKéMON that there are children who use its expansive belly as a place to play."},{"version":"emerald","text":"SNORLAX’s typical day consists of nothing more than eating and sleeping. It is such a docile POKéMON that there are children who use its big belly as a place to play."},{"version":"firered","text":"It is not satisfied unless it eats over 880 pounds of food every day. When it is done eating, it goes promptly to sleep."},{"version":"diamond","text":"Its stomach can digest any kind of food, even if it happens to be moldy or rotten."},{"version":"pearl","text":"It stops eating only to sleep. It doesn’t feel full unless it eats nearly 900 pounds a day."},{"version":"platinum","text":"When its belly is full, it becomes too lethargic to even lift a finger, so it is safe to bounce on its belly."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"What sounds like its cry may actually be its snores or the rumblings of its hungry belly."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"Its stomach’s digestive juices can dissolve any kind of poison. It can even eat things off the ground."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Snorlax’s typical day consists of nothing more than eating and sleeping. It is such a docile Pokémon that there are children who use its expansive belly as a place to play."},{"version":"sun","text":"Its stomach is said to be incomparably strong. Even Muk’s poison is nothing more than a hint of spice on Snorlax’s tongue."},{"version":"moon","text":"It eats nearly 900 pounds of food every day. It starts nodding off while eating—and continues to eat even while it’s asleep."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It doesn’t do anything other than eat and sleep. When prompted to make a serious effort, though, it apparently displays awesome power."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It has no interest in anything other than eating. Even if you climb up on its stomach while it’s napping, it doesn’t seem to mind at all!"},{"version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon’s stomach is so strong, even eating moldy or rotten food will not affect it."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"This glutton appears in villages without warning and devours the entirety of their rice granaries—such occurrences have long been counted among the gravest of disasters."}],"flavorPt":"Este glutão aparece nas aldeias sem aviso prévio e devora todos os seus celeiros de arroz – tais ocorrências têm sido consideradas entre os 